MISSION_ID=P5-FL20-R1-ALPHA-ACTIVATION-MASTER-PLAN-V2

## Revision purpose

This document is the activation-phase equivalent of a complete P5 execution taskbook. It is
not merely a checklist. It defines the authority hierarchy, current machine state, trust
domains, ordered transition graph, evidence requirements, actor boundaries, information
ordering, failure taxonomy, resume semantics, agent harness, human handoff protocol, and final
acceptance floors from the current pre-ceremony state through the first real P3 alpha
landscape.

The plan is deliberately self-contained enough that a new Fable session need not inherit
reasoning from the old chat. The exact FL20-R1 bytes and live VPS state remain the higher
source of truth.

