- create an independent admin private key;
- clear `SUDO_USER` to bypass actor checks;
- fabricate provider recovery proof;
- fabricate admin-login proof;
- fabricate cloud-regrant neutralization;
- generate, receive, or store the owner private signing key;
- fabricate direct owner intent;
